/f5/f5b9dd39e03e7a8c984d6a38db8dc32326669d134ff0b5aa012c421308b48351.svg)\nFind $f(D)$ if $f(X)=-X^2+3X+2.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the polynomial, interpreting any constants as multiples of the identity matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(X) & =-{X}^{2}+3X+2 \\\\  & =-{X}^{2}+3X+2I\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we want to find $f(D)=-D^2+3D+2I.$\n\nLet's calculate $D^2$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}^{2} & =D\\cdot D \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -10 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can evaluate $f(D)\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(D) & =-{D}^{2}+3D+2I \\\\  & =-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -10 \\\\ 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 10 \\\\ 0 & -9\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 15 \\\\ 0 & -9\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1+3+2 & 10+15+0 \\\\ 0 & -9-9+2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 25 \\\\ 0 & -16\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "61443225-bc08-5d36-a603-3a1d7e392a98" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049304} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050396} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050979}] :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115815 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ab5cc2ba-0dd3-53ee-85de-59fa0989f944" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -15\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113828} {:answer/id #uuid "ae301954-19e9-53b7-a9ef-b3628052b8c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 \\\\ 12 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113829} {:answer/id #uuid "b49126b5-7e77-5bb4-adfb-28921cbc67b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/v